$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Helaram" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Starry Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Recently the Domalit company has been acquired through means of a hostile corporate buyout.  The new management that has come in has fired many former employees and removed the former CEO.  But the former Domalit employees aren't going to go without a fight, and this has now escalated into an armed conflict between the employees loyal to the former <vServer::teamName0> CEO and those loyal to the new <vServer::teamName1> CEO.  Whichever CEO remains standing after the bloody conflict ahead will acquire full rights to the multi-trillion dollar company!\n\nProtect your CEO while attempting to find and kill the enemy CEO.  The first team to assassinate the enemy CEO will be declared the victor!";
